Z||000007||Fierowrecker||04-01-2001||09:32 AM||||Dread not...<BR>Go down to NAPA and pick up a set of loaded calipers and rotors for an 89 Pont Grand Am...<BR>Put those in the rear and you will be pleased!<BR>You loose the e-brake, BWTF...<BR>$144 with $44 core charge for the pair...<BR>crash...<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000008||skitime||04-01-2001||10:19 AM||||Dreadnot do not get the Grand Am brakes!  Here in PA you must have a functioning emergency brake to pass state inspection. Go to Autozone and get a rebuilt Fiero unit. ||||reg||1
